(polyline (pts (xy 22.86 217.17) (xy 400.05 217.17) (xy 400.05 251.46) (xy 22.86 251.46) (xy 22.86 217.17)) (stroke (width 0.254) (type dash)) (fill (type none)) (uuid "1334b34b-d3d0-52e9-b2e8-5581aa27eeb2"))
(text "POWER ON: isolate signals -> enable TOUCH_3V3 -> qualify rail -> perform full GT911 address/reset sequence -> connect I/O.\nPOWER OFF: stop bus traffic -> disable touch wake -> isolate all four signals -> switch domain off.\nR417/R418 are local 10k pull-ups; include the panel and AON pull-ups in rise-time/current checks. R419/R420 define RESET/INT defaults.\nRetain the passive FP6 extension. Use the panel documentation for contact orientation/pin order; no active adapter function assumed." (at 30.48 229.87 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left top)) (uuid "371c2a74-51de-5b31-8bca-c2f01bd03835"))
(text "The domain PWR_FLAG declares the intended powered state; it is not a protection component. Verify ramp, residual voltage and injection on the board." (at 22.86 283.21 0) (effects (font (size 1.0 1.0)) (justify left top)) (uuid "193b45be-7eb1-50d2-bbe8-1c88b66463c8"))
